(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF COMMERCE AND INDUSTRY) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: STARTUP INDIA SEED FUND SCHEME \(SISFS\) / DPIIT / DESIGNATED INCUBATORS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Financial assistance to early-stage DPIIT-recognized startups for proof of) Tj
T*
(concept, prototype development, product trials, market entry, and) Tj
T*
(commercialization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. A startup recognized by DPIIT, incorporated not more than 2 years ago at) Tj
T*
(   the time of application.) Tj
T*
(2. Must have a viable business idea with proof of concept or prototype.) Tj
T*
(3. Must not have received more than Rs. 10 Lakh in monetary support under) Tj
T*
(   other Central or State government schemes.) Tj
T*
(4. Indian promoters must hold at least 51% shareholding in the startup.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Up to Rs. 20 Lakh as grant for Proof of Concept / prototype validation; up) Tj
T*
(   to Rs. 50 Lakh through convertible debentures or debt-linked instruments) Tj
T*
(   for commercialization.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 100.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 50.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. DPIIT Certificate of Recognition) Tj
T*
(2. Certificate of Incorporation \(Pvt Ltd or LLP\)) Tj
T*
(3. Pitch Deck & Business Plan) Tj
T*
(4. Shareholding Pattern Declaration \(CA certified\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via SISFS Portal \(seedfund.startupindia.gov.in\)) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://seedfund.startupindia.gov.in) Tj
T*
ET
